              "# Latest US-China Trade Talks End With a Whimper\nOn August 22 and 23 in Washington, DC, the United States and China held the latest round of talks seeking a possible end to their ongoing trade war. It was the first dialogue since the first round of U.S. tariffs on $34 billion worth of Chinese goods – and China’s reciprocal duties – went into effect on July 6. A second round of tariffs, on an additional $16 billion of Chinese products, went into effect on Thursday, as the talks were ongoing",
